    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shakwinha sha būsu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū wenha shakwinha sha būsu kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA, ī shakwinha shakwe būkūbiza būsu būnogu, ūwitīīla na maguta a higūlya, hūna ūbūtūūlīla na būbbani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ūbatwalīla bitūnja ba ng'wa Alooni, a bagabīji; ū ngabīji akūsola būsu būgehu mu shiganza, hamò na a maguta, nū būbbani ū bose. Ī shenīsho akūshipemba ha ng'walīlo shibize shiizūkījo; ī shenīsho shakwinha sha kūfunyiwa mu nzīla ya moto, sha ng'waso gwa kūnyeja SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būsu bo shakwinha shenīsho ūbo būkūsaaga, bo ng'wa Alooni na bitūnja bakwe; ī shoi shilī shakwinha sheela no no no; ibbudīka lya shakwinha īsho shikafunyiagwa kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA mu nzīla ya moto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū wenha shakwinha sha būsu mu mbika ya shikolo shizugile ng'wizugīlo lya būgubbanīje, shikūbiza sha būsu būnogu. Jibize keki ja būsu būtī na shibimbya būsangije maguta, nūūlū migatī mikalamuku; nayo ya būsu būtī na shibimbya, īchaagije maguta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shakwinha shako sha būsu ūlū shikalangilwe h'ikalangīlo, shikūbiza sha būsu būnogu būsangije maguta, būtī na shibimbya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkūshipondagūla shimenyagūke, hūna ūshitūūlīle maguta; ī shenīsho shilī shakwinha sha būsu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shakwinha shako sha būsu ūlū sha kūzugwa mu shiseme shigalī galī, shikūbiza sha būsu būnogu būlī na maguta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shakwinha sha būsu īsho shibeejiwe kūfuma mu shikolo shenīshi, ūkūshenha kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, ūng'winhe ngabīji ashitwale ha ng'walīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ū mu shakwinha sha būsu shenīshi, akūsola shigehu sha kwizūkīja, hūna ashipembe ha ng'walīlo shibize shakwinha sha kūfunyiwa mu nzīla ya moto, sha ng'waso gwa kūnyeja SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shakwinha sha būsu shenīsho, īsho shilasaage shilī sha ng'wa Alooni na bitūnja bakwe; ī shoi shilī ibbudīka lya shakwinha sheela no no no, īsho sha kūfunyiwa kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA mu nzīla ya moto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shibimbya na munhu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī shakwinha sha būsu īsho ūkūmfunīja SEEBA shikūbiza shitī na shibimbya. Yaya gete kūpemba shibimbya nūūlū būūkī ū mu shakwinha shose shose īsho ūlīmfunīja SEEBA, mu nzīla ya moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ī shoi ūdūgije ū kūshenha ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, gītī shakwinha sha matwajo ga kwandya, alīyo shitī sha kūfunyiwa ha ng'walīlo gītī sha ng'waso gwa kūyeja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pyī ī shakwinha shako sha būsu ūkūyūshisanja na munhu. Ū mu shakwinha shako sha būsu yaya ū kūleka kūtwīīla mo ū munhu gw'ilagane lya ng'wa Mulungu wako; ī shakwinha shako pyī ī shose ūkūyūshitwīla munhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ūlū wenha kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA matwajo ga kwandya kūbiza sha shakwinha sha būsu, funyaga būsu wa kūfuma mu mbeke ja mangala mapya, ga kwanikīlwa ha moto gūūma hūna ī mbeke jūshiiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būsu wenūbo ūkūbūtūūlīla maguta na būbbani; ī shoi shilī shakwinha sha būsu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ngabīji akūpemba ibbudīka lya būsu wenūbo, shibize shiizūkījo, na a maguta nū būbbani ū bose ūbo būlīho hoi; shibize shakwinha sha kūfunyiwa kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA mu nzīla ya moto.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
